@startuml
title Current — Communication diagram for POST /detections
top to bottom direction
skinparam objectAttributeIconSize 0

object "API Client" as Client
object "DetectionsController" as Controller
object "Zod validation pipe" as Zod
object "DetectionsService" as Service
object "PrismaService" as Prisma
object "PostgreSQL" as DB

Client --> Controller : 1. POST /detections (JSON)
Controller --> Zod : 1.1 parse createDetectionSchema
Controller --> Service : 2. create(dto)
Service --> Prisma : 2.1 detection.create(data)
Prisma --> DB : 2.2 INSERT Detection

note right of DB
  Return outcomes:
  201 full record when insert succeeds
  400 when Zod validation fails
  409 when eventId violates the unique constraint
  Other database errors propagate as server errors.
end note

note bottom of Client
  Communication-style notation numbers the current
  request path. Database persistence is its side effect.
end note
@enduml
